        -- NOTHING-kind (includes): "including:" the twelve listed activities
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

§ `s 2025(h)(1)(F)(v) and (vi) Sanctions and standards`

-- src:2231 | The Secretary shall establish standards for employment activities described in subclauses (I), (II), and (III) of clause (iv) that ensure that failure to work for reasons beyond the control of an individual, such as involuntary reduction in hours of employment, shall not result in ineligibility.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) failure to work for reasons beyond control (src:2231)
GIVEN `the activity is an employment activity described in subclause (I), (II), or (III) of clause (iv)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the failure to work is for reasons beyond the control of the individual` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) the failure to work results in ineligibility` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "failure to work for reasons beyond the control of an individual, such as involuntary reduction in hours of employment, shall not result in ineligibility"
        IF `the activity is an employment activity described in subclause (I), (II), or (III) of clause (iv)` AND `the failure to work is for reasons beyond the control of the individual` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the standards are for "employment activities described in subclauses (I), (II), and (III) of clause (iv)" and for failures "beyond the control of an individual"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) the Secretary shall establish standards (src:2231)
GIVEN `the Secretary has established standards for employment activities described in subclauses (I), (II), and (III) of clause (iv)` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the standards ensure that failure to work for reasons beyond the control of an individual shall not result in ineligibility` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) the Secretary has established the standards` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Secretary has established standards for employment activities described in subclauses (I), (II), and (III) of clause (iv)` AND `the standards ensure that failure to work for reasons beyond the control of an individual shall not result in ineligibility` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Secretary shall establish standards for employment activities described in subclauses (I), (II), and (III) of clause (iv) that ensure"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2226 | Subject to clause (vi), no work registrant shall be eligible to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program if the individual refuses without good cause to participate in an employment and training program under this subparagraph, to the extent required by the State agency.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(v) a work registrant who refuses without good cause is ineligible (src:2226)
GIVEN `the individual is a work registrant` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual refuses to participate in an employment and training program under this subparagraph` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency requires the participation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the individual has good cause for the refusal` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) the failure to work results in ineligibility` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(v) the work registrant is ineligible to participate in the supplemental nutrition assistance program` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "shall not result in ineligibility"
        IF `the individual is a work registrant` AND `the individual refuses to participate in an employment and training program under this subparagraph` AND `the State agency requires the participation` AND `s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(II) the failure to work results in ineligibility` EQUALS JUST FALSE THEN JUST FALSE
        IF `the individual is a work registrant` AND `the individual refuses to participate in an employment and training program under this subparagraph` AND `the State agency requires the participation` THEN
            CONSIDER `the individual has good cause for the refusal`
            WHEN JUST FALSE THEN JUST TRUE
            -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "no work registrant shall be eligible ... if the individual refuses without good cause"; a refusal with good cause is not answered
            WHEN JUST TRUE THEN NOTHING
            -- NOTHING-kind (undefined term): "good cause" is not defined in this subparagraph, and section 2025(c)(9) defines it for subsection (c) only
            OTHERWISE NOTHING
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "if the individual refuses without good cause to participate in an employment and training program under this subparagraph, to the extent required by the State agency"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2229 | Employment and training activities under this subparagraph shall be considered to be carried out under section 2015(d) of this title, including for the purpose of satisfying any conditions of participation and duration of ineligibility.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(I) considered to be carried out under section 2015(d) (src:2229)
GIVEN `the activities are employment and training activities under this subparagraph` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(I) the activities are considered to be carried out under section 2015(d)` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the activities are employment and training activities under this subparagraph` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Employment and training activities under this subparagraph shall be considered to be carried out under section 2015(d)"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

-- src:2233 | Before assigning a work registrant to mandatory employment and training activities, a State agency shall—
-- src:2234 | (aa) assess whether the work registrant is participating in substantial employment and training activities outside of the pilot project that are expected to result in the work registrant gaining increased skills, training, work, or experience consistent with the objectives of the pilot project; and
-- src:2235 | (bb) if determined to be acceptable, count hours engaged in the activities toward any minimum participation requirement.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(III) participation in other programs (src:2233-2235)
GIVEN `the State agency assessed whether the work registrant is participating in substantial employment and training activities outside of the pilot project that are expected to result in the work registrant gaining increased skills, training, work, or experience consistent with the objectives of the pilot project` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the activities were determined to be acceptable` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency counted the hours engaged in the activities toward any minimum participation requirement` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vi)(III) the State agency complied before assigning the work registrant to mandatory activities` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Before assigning a work registrant to mandatory employment and training activities, a State agency shall— (aa) assess"
        IF (NOT `the State agency assessed whether the work registrant is participating in substantial employment and training activities outside of the pilot project that are expected to result in the work registrant gaining increased skills, training, work, or experience consistent with the objectives of the pilot project`) THEN JUST FALSE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "if determined to be acceptable, count hours engaged in the activities toward any minimum participation requirement"
        IF `the activities were determined to be acceptable` AND (NOT `the State agency counted the hours engaged in the activities toward any minimum participation requirement`) THEN JUST FALSE
        OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

§ `s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii) Evaluation and reporting`

-- src:2239 | The Secretary shall, under such terms and conditions as the Secretary determines to be appropriate, conduct for each State agency that enters into a cooperative agreement under clause (i) an independent longitudinal evaluation of each pilot project of the State agency under this subparagraph, with results reported not less frequently than in consecutive 12-month increments.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I)(aa) independent longitudinal evaluation (src:2239)
GIVEN `the Secretary conducts an independent longitudinal evaluation of each pilot project of the State agency` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the State agency has entered into a cooperative agreement under clause (i)` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I) the Secretary has conducted the independent evaluation as required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Secretary conducts an independent longitudinal evaluation of each pilot project of the State agency` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The Secretary shall, under such terms and conditions as the Secretary determines to be appropriate, conduct for each State agency that enters into a cooperative agreement under clause (i) an independent longitudinal evaluation"
        IF `the State agency has entered into a cooperative agreement under clause (i)` THEN JUST FALSE
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the evaluation is "for each State agency that enters into a cooperative agreement"
        OTHERWISE NOTHING

@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I)(aa) results reported not less frequently than in consecutive 12-month increments (src:2239)
GIVEN `months between reports of results` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I)(aa) the reporting of results is frequent enough` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `months between reports of results` AT MOST 12 THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "with results reported not less frequently than in consecutive 12-month increments"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2243 | The independent evaluation shall use valid statistical methods that can determine, for each pilot project, the difference, if any, between supplemental nutrition assistance and other public benefit receipt expenditures, employment, earnings and other impacts as determined by the Secretary—
-- src:2244 | (AA) as a result of the employment and training programs and services provided by the State agency under the pilot project; as compared to
-- src:2245 | (BB) a control group that is not subject to the employment and training programs and services provided by the State agency under the pilot project.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I)(cc) methodology (src:2243-2245)
GIVEN `the evaluation uses valid statistical methods` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it determines, for each pilot project, the difference between the receipt and impacts as a result of the programs and services and those of a control group` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the control group is not subject to the employment and training programs and services provided by the State agency under the pilot project` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(I)(cc) the evaluation uses the methodology required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the evaluation uses valid statistical methods` AND `it determines, for each pilot project, the difference between the receipt and impacts as a result of the programs and services and those of a control group` AND `the control group is not subject to the employment and training programs and services provided by the State agency under the pilot project` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The independent evaluation shall use valid statistical methods"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- "until the completion" is read as: a December 31 on or after the completion date has no report due (NOTES.md, fork F-10).
-- src:2247 | Not later than December 31, 2015, and each December 31 thereafter until the completion of the last evaluation under subclause (I), the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate and share broadly, including by posting on the Internet website of the Department of Agriculture, a report that includes a description of—
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) each December 31 from 2015 until the last evaluation is completed (src:2247)
GIVEN `calendar year` IS A NUMBER
      `date the last evaluation under subclause (I) was completed, if it has been` IS A MAYBE DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) a report is due on 31 December of the year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Not later than December 31, 2015, and each December 31 thereafter" names no report for an earlier year
        IF (NOT (`calendar year` AT LEAST 2015)) THEN NOTHING
        OTHERWISE
            CONSIDER `date the last evaluation under subclause (I) was completed, if it has been`
            WHEN JUST completed THEN
                BRANCH
                    IF (NOT (completed AT MOST (Date 31 12 `calendar year`))) THEN JUST TRUE
                    -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "each December 31 thereafter until the completion of the last evaluation under subclause (I)"
                    OTHERWISE JUST FALSE
            OTHERWISE JUST TRUE

@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) not later than December 31 (src:2247)
GIVEN `calendar year` IS A NUMBER
      `date the report is submitted` IS A DATE
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) the report is submitted in time` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `date the report is submitted` AT MOST (Date 31 12 `calendar year`) THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Not later than December 31, 2015, and each December 31 thereafter"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) submit to the Committees and share broadly (src:2247)
GIVEN `the Secretary submits the report to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Secretary submits the report to the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Secretary shares the report broadly, including by posting it on the Internet website of the Department of Agriculture` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) the report is submitted and shared as required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `the Secretary submits the report to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives` AND `the Secretary submits the report to the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate` AND `the Secretary shares the report broadly, including by posting it on the Internet website of the Department of Agriculture` THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate and share broadly"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2247 | Not later than December 31, 2015, and each December 31 thereafter until the completion of the last evaluation under subclause (I), the Secretary shall submit to the Committee on Agriculture of the House of Representatives and the Committee on Agriculture, Nutrition, and Forestry of the Senate and share broadly, including by posting on the Internet website of the Department of Agriculture, a report that includes a description of—
-- src:2248 | (aa) the status of each pilot project carried out under this subparagraph;
-- src:2249 | (bb) the results of the evaluation completed during the previous fiscal year;
-- src:2250 | (cc) to the maximum extent practicable, baseline information relevant to the stated goals and desired outcomes of the pilot project;
-- src:2251 | (dd) the employment and training programs and services each State tested under the pilot, including—
-- src:2252 | (AA) the system of the State for assessing the ability of work registrants to participate in and meet the requirements of employment and training activities and assigning work registrants to appropriate activities; and
-- src:2253 | (BB) the employment and training activities and services provided under the pilot;
-- src:2254 | (ee) the impact of the employment and training programs and services on appropriate employment, income, and public benefit receipt as well as other outcomes among households participating in the pilot project, relative to households not participating; and
-- src:2255 | (ff) the steps and funding necessary to incorporate into State employment and training programs and services the components of the pilot projects that demonstrate increased employment and earnings.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II)(aa)-(ff) what the report describes (src:2247-2255)
GIVEN `it describes the status of each pilot project` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the results of the evaluation completed during the previous fiscal year` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes, to the maximum extent practicable, baseline information relevant to the stated goals and desired outcomes of the pilot project` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the system of the State for assessing the ability of work registrants and assigning them to appropriate activities` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the employment and training activities and services provided under the pilot` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the impact on appropriate employment, income, and public benefit receipt as well as other outcomes among households participating, relative to households not participating` IS A BOOLEAN
      `it describes the steps and funding necessary to incorporate into State employment and training programs the components that demonstrate increased employment and earnings` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(vii)(II) the report describes what is required` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `it describes the status of each pilot project`
            AND `it describes the results of the evaluation completed during the previous fiscal year`
            AND `it describes, to the maximum extent practicable, baseline information relevant to the stated goals and desired outcomes of the pilot project`
            AND `it describes the system of the State for assessing the ability of work registrants and assigning them to appropriate activities`
            AND `it describes the employment and training activities and services provided under the pilot`
            AND `it describes the impact on appropriate employment, income, and public benefit receipt as well as other outcomes among households participating, relative to households not participating`
            AND `it describes the steps and funding necessary to incorporate into State employment and training programs the components that demonstrate increased employment and earnings`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "a report that includes a description of— (aa) the status of each pilot project"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

§ `s 2025(h)(1)(F)(viii) Funding`

-- src:2258 | Subject to subclause (II), from amounts made available under section 2027(a)(1) of this title, the Secretary shall use to carry out this subparagraph—
