GIVEN `fiscal year` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A MAYBE NUMBER
`s 2025(h)(1)(F)(viii)(I) the amount the Secretary shall use to carry out the subparagraph for the fiscal year` MEANS
    BRANCH
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2014 THEN JUST 10_000_000
        IF `fiscal year` EQUALS 2015 THEN JUST 190_000_000
        -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the clause names "for fiscal year 2014" and "for fiscal year 2015" only
