    BRANCH
        IF `last day the pilot project is in effect` AT MOST (`add years` `first day the pilot project is in effect` 3) THEN JUST TRUE
        -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "Each pilot project shall be in effect for not more than 3 years"
        OTHERWISE JUST FALSE

-- src:2267 | Funds made available under subclause (I) shall remain available through September 30, 2018.
@ref s 2025(h)(1)(F)(viii)(III) available through September 30, 2018 (src:2267)
GIVEN `date` IS A DATE
